# 压缩与包
*.zip binary
*.tar binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.tar.bz2 binary
*.tbz2 binary
*.tar.xz binary
*.7z binary
*.rar binary
*.gz binary
*.bz2 binary
*.xz binary
*.whl binary
*.egg binary

# 动态与静态库
